Any time you deal damage with a psionic ability you incur a negative biofeedback in your foes, stacking up to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] times for 5 turns.

Each stack reduces their physical save by [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)], defense and armour by [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)].

This effect may only occur once per turn.
